(Cache folder: %TEMP%\\LiveGardenTVPlus\\epg_cache): (Cache map: %TEMP%\\LiveGardenTVPlus\\epg_cache)
(Completely voluntary – no features are blocked): (Folslein frijwillich - gjin funksjes wurde blokkearre)
(No description): (Gjin beskriuwing)
• Add / rename / delete groups.: • Add / omneame / wiskje groepen.
• Buffer slider: adjust HLS buffer (1‑10 seconds).: • Buffer slider: oanpasse HLS buffer (1-10 sekonden).
• Check URL availability (only visible channels).: • Kontrolearje URL beskikber (allinne sichtbere kanalen).
• Edit channel names, groups, URLs, logos, tvg-id, country, languages, favorites.: • Kanaalnammen, groepen, URL's, logo's, tvg-id, lân, talen, favoriten bewurkje.
• Edit multiple URLs per channel (popup window).: • Bewurkje meardere URLs per kanaal (popup finster).
• Enrich with EPG: adds missing tvg-id using fuzzy matching.: • Ferrykje mei EPG: foeget ûntbrekkende tvg-id ta mei fuzzy matching.
• EPG info displayed in status bar for current channel.: • EPG info werjûn yn status bar foar aktuele kanaal.
• Export OK / FAIL / filtered lists as M3U or JSON.: • Eksportearje OK / FAIL / filtere listen as M3U of JSON.
• Fetch logos from remote repository (OwnerPlugins/logos).: • Fetch logos út remote repository (OwnerPlugins / logos).
• Fullscreen UI: hides sidebar and status bar (ESC to exit).: • Folslein skerm UI: ferberget sydbalke en statusbalke (ESC om út te gean).
• Hide/Show channel list button.: • Ferbergje / Lit kanaal list knop.
• Import JSON (local or URL) with flexible field mapping (auto-detect, save mapping).: • Ymportearje JSON (lokaal of URL) mei fleksibele fjildmapping (auto-detect, bewarje mapping).
• Picture‑in‑Picture (PIP) button.: • Knop Picture-in-Picture (PIP).
• Playback speed: 0.5x, 1x, 2x buttons.: • Wiedergabe snelheid: 0,5x, 1x, 2x knoppen.
• Sort any column by clicking header; use 'Reset Order' to revert to original order.: • Sortearje elke kolom troch te klikken op koptekst; brûk 'Reset Order' om werom te gean nei de orizjinele oarder.
• Timeshift: pause live stream; drag slider to seek back; press 'Live' to return.: • Timeshift: live stream stopje; sleep slider om werom te sykjen; druk op 'Live' om werom te gean.
